摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin for AST context compression, test log filtering, and token budget guard","id":"gh:1352326572","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-context-lens","slug":"GooDAnDReaDY/dsh-context-lens","topics":["context","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","token-guard"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin for AST context compression, test log filtering, and token budget guard"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 📦 @goodandready/dsh-context-lens"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Semantic AST Code Skeletonizer & Test Log Condenser for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"🇬🇧 English •\n🇷🇺 Русский •\n🇨🇳 中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"⭐ If you like this plugin, please star it on GitHub — it shows me that the plugin is useful to you a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd motivates me to keep developing it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🐛 If you find a bug or would like to request a feature, open a GitHub issue in any language — I will"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" review your proposal and implement useful suggestions in a future plugin version."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## ⚡ Overview & Semantic Compression Focus"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> **Note on DSH Core vs Plugin Responsibility:**\n> Context budgeting, token counting, tool result pr"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"uning (`head/middle/tail`), and spilling long results to disk (`dsh-spill-policy`, `dsh-compaction-t"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ool-result-pruner`, `dsh-token-meter`) are natively managed by the **DSH core (>= 0.1.5)**.\n> **`dsh"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"-context-lens`** focuses strictly on what the core does not do — **semantic compression**:\n> 1. **AS"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"T Code Skeletons**: Signatures, interfaces, exported types, and doc comments instead of whole functi"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"on/method bodies across 9+ languages.\n> 2. **Path-Based Focus**: Full code for active editing target"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"s while surrounding workspace files remain skeletonized.\n> 3. **Test & Build Log Compression**: Fail"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"ures, errors, stack traces, and test summary instead of raw multi-megabyte terminal streams."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 1. 🧬 Multi-Language AST Structural Skeletonizer\n* **Supported Languages**: TypeScript, JavaScrip"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"t, Python, Go, C/C++, Rust, Java, and SQL DDL.\n* **Structural Preservation**: Retains imports, class"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"es, structs, interfaces, exported types, function signatures, and doc comments while discarding inne"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"r implementation bodies.\n* **Multiline Signature Support**: Seamlessly accumulates complex multiline"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" generic arguments, return types, and parameter lists up to block delimiters.\n* **Pure Regex Impleme"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ntation**: Zero heavy native dependencies or binary parser overhead; runs lightning-fast across any "},{"id":"p11s7","text":": Zero heavy native dependencies or binary parser overhead; runs lightning-fast across any platform."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 2. 📋 Intelligent Test & Build Log Condenser\n* **Supported Test Runners & Tools**: Jest, Vitest, "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"Pytest, `node --test`, Go test, Cargo, Webpack, Vite, TSC, Maven, Gradle.\n* **Targeted Extraction**:"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" Identifies and preserves critical error messages, stack traces, assertion differences (`Expected .."},{"id":"p12s4","text":". Received ...`), and failure context windows.\n* **Successful Run Summarization**: Automatically col"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"lapses passing runs (0 failures) into concise summary lines.\n* **Auto-Mode Discrimination**: Evaluat"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"es command context and text signatures to ensure normal non-test outputs are preserved untouched for"},{"id":"p12s7","text":" core pruning.\n* **3 Aggressiveness Modes**:\n- `raw`: Removes noise lines while keeping general exec"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"ution order.\n- `balanced`: Preserves failure sections with surrounding context windows (default).\n- "},{"id":"p12s9","text":"`aggressive`: Extracts strictly error lines and stack frames."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### 3. 🎯 Path Focus Management\n* Designate specific files or folders as active working targets for t"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"he current task.\n* Files in focus bypass AST skeletonization, returning complete implementation code"},{"id":"p13s3","text":".\n* Focus state is strictly scoped per session (`sessionId`)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## 🛠️ Agent Tools Reference (Consolidated to 2 Tools)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"All tools strictly conform to the DeepSeek Harness tool specification by providing `output.render` r"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"eturning structured `ContentBlock[]` arrays (`[{ type: 'text', text: ... }]`), ensuring 100% session"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ructured `ContentBlock[]` arrays (`[{ type: 'text', text: ... }]`), ensuring 100% session stability."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Tool Name | Action / Mode | Parameters | Description |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `context_lens_code` | `action: \"skeleton\"` (default) | `filePath?`, `code?`, `language?`, `maxDept"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"h?`, `sessionId?` | Generates a clean structural AST skeleton directly from `filePath` (reading file"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" without preliminary `read_file` token waste) or from `code`. If file is in active session focus, re"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"turns full implementation |\n| `context_lens_code` | `action: \"focus\"` | `paths: string[]`, `sessionI"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"d?` | Sets active focus file paths or patterns for the current session |\n| `context_lens_code` | `ac"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"tion: \"get_focus\"` | `sessionId?` | Retrieves active focus paths for the session |\n| `context_lens_c"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"ode` | `action: \"clear_focus\"` | `sessionId?` | Clears focus paths for the session |\n| `context_lens"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"_log` | N/A | `text` *(or `log`)*, `mode?`, `maxLines?`, `auto?`, `command?` | Compresses test and b"},{"id":"p17s9","text":"uild output logs, preserving failures, stack traces, and summary. In `auto: true`, only runs on reco"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"gnized test/build outputs |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration Schema"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Configured via the DSH Settings page (`plugins.row.config` / `plugins.item`):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Property | Type | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `compressionMode` | `string` | `'balanced'` | Log compression aggressiveness (`raw`, `balanced`, `"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"aggressive`) |\n| `astSkeletonMaxDepth` | `number` | `3` | Max depth for AST skeleton generation |\n| "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`autoCompressThreshold` | `number` | `4000` | Character threshold for auto-compressing test/build lo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"gs when invoking `context_lens_log` with `auto: true` (0 to disable) |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT © GooDAnDReaDY"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
